&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Walk-ins welcome! We can’t wait to meet you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
